abstract: >-
  A metadata extractor agent to augment the metadata
  retrieval of any TeSS training resource. The input is the
  URL of a training material, the output is a JSON file with
  the following fields: description, licence, status,
  contact, doi, version, authors, contributors,
  target_audience, prerequisites, competency_level,
  learning_objectives, date_created, date_modified,
  date_published.
